      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Top margin",
          "value": "<p>O my brother, Maulat has wed, and it was a terrible wedding. We read all the good [positive] that you described about Ab\u016b Ibr\u0101h\u012bm Ish\u0101q, may God grant him a long life.</p>\n<p>May God allow you to witness joy from Maulat and Najiyya. Peace.</p>",
